id: scholars-intellect
name: Scholar’s Intellect
talentCategory: racial
race: neo-tuffle
prerequisites: Neo-Tuffle
description: >
  Thanks to the mighty intellect instilled in you by your forebears, you display superior knowledge and skills.
text: >
  Scholar’s Intellect: Thanks to the mighty intellect instilled in you by your forebears, you display superior knowledge and skills.
  –Prerequisites: Neo-Tuffle
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of any Skill Clash made against your Inferior by 1.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When rolling for a Skill Clash, you may spend up to 2 Revenge Points to increase the Dice Score of that Skill Clash by 1 for each Revenge Point spent.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Skill Clash between you and your Inferior this Round (Tuffle Superiority's), whichever side opened it (chat.mjs scholarClashBonus).
allow scholar.inferior;
# (2) Boxes in your window before a Skill Clash's roll, once a Round: a Revenge Point each, 1 each (chat.mjs scholarRevengeOpen).
allow scholar.revenge;
